# Regression: two deferred async signals to the same object, where the first
# body messages an object further right. Layout inserts a Pause via check()
# and re-lays-out, exercising the reset() path (which used to crash on an
# undeclared `refs` variable).
a.f() {
	b > s1() {
		c.x()
	}
	b > s2()
}
